@startuml
title Event Flow – appointment.created

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "appointments-service" as App
component "RabbitMQ\nappointments.exchange" as Rabbit
component "notes-service" as Notes
component "clients-service" as Clients
component "doctors-service" as Doctors

App --> Rabbit : publish\nAppointmentCreatedEvent\nroutingKey=appointment.created

Rabbit --> Notes : deliver\nappointment.created\n(queue notes.appointment.created.queue)
Notes --> Notes : cria AppointmentRecord\ndefault

Rabbit --> Clients : deliver\nappointment.created\n(queue appointments.created.clients.queue)
Clients --> Clients : atualiza lastAppointmentDate\n+ appointmentCount

Rabbit --> Doctors : deliver\nappointment.created\n(queue appointments.created.doctors.queue)
Doctors --> Doctors : atualiza totalAppointments\n+ lastAppointment

@enduml
